  << /ActualText (\200 Expanded a narrow custom\055template initiative into an end\055to\055end enterprise workflow\054 defining discovery\054 organization\054 safe publishing\054 and multi\055user permission models\056\n\200 Moved signup from an external redirect into four pre\055products\054 validated stronger conversion through experimentation\054 and supported a portfolio\055wide rollout\056\n\200 Led the multi\055product Checkout redesign\054 replacing an unscalable legacy flow and enabling scalable add\055on monetization in support of ARR growth\056\n\200 Designed an enterprise seat trial across four invitation surfaces\054 delivering statistically significant gains in invitation and member\055addition behavior and informing subsequent growth work\056\n\200 Shipped a public\055board signup CTA after a statistically significant acquisition test\054 then redesigned template discovery when the primary conversion effect was flat\056)
